><mn>792</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>w</mi></math>, or <math alttext=\"StartFraction 792 x Over 5 EndFraction equals w\"><mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mfrac>\n<mrow>\n<mn>792</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n<mn>5</mn>\n</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mi>w</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Therefore, the number of ounces of water the hose puts in the bucket in <math alttext=\"9 y\"><mrow>\n<mn>9</mn>\n<mi>y</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math> minutes can be represented by the expression <math alttext=\"StartFraction 792 x Over 5 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n<mfrac>\n<mrow>\n<mn>792</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n<mn>5</mn>\n</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>","parenttemplatename":null,"parenttemplateid":null,"templateclusterid":null,"templateclustername":null,"origin":null,"position":null,"image_count":0,"raw_list":{"updateDate":1743430554988,"pPcc":"SAT#Q","questionId":"21e539a0","skill_cd":"Q.A.","score_band_range_cd":6,"skill_desc":"Ratios, rates, proportional relationships, and units","createDate":1743430554988,"program":"SAT","primary_class_cd_desc":"Problem-Solving and Data Analysis","ibn":"","external_id":"ea65c30d-d2d3-4c66-b79e-881cd28208cf","primary_class_cd":"Q","uId":"c375a3fe-3bab-4e34-96a9-275126508ae6","difficulty":"H"},"raw_detail":{"type":"mcq","stem":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">A landscaper uses a hose that puts <math alttext=\"88 x\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>88</mn>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math> ounces of water in a bucket in <math alttext=\"5 y\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t<mi>y</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math> minutes. Which expression represents the number of ounces of water the hose puts in the bucket in <math alttext=\"9 y\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>9</mn>\n\t<mi>y</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math> minutes at this rate?</p>","keys":["4aded792-90cd-48bb-bbf5-23a8f5362592"],"answerOptions":[{"id":"6ea1e0b4-e030-4124-8d13-5d9885f49d7d","content":"<p><math alttext=\"StartFraction 9 x Over 440 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>9</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mn>440</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"7ca13d07-cd7e-427d-9413-aea9d8d42301","content":"<p><math alttext=\"StartFraction 440 x Over 9 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>440</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mn>9</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"9cb935bc-c4a0-487e-b065-81fea6755442","content":"<p><math alttext=\"StartFraction 5 x Over 792 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mn>792</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"4aded792-90cd-48bb-bbf5-23a8f5362592","content":"<p><math alttext=\"StartFraction 792 x Over 5 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>792</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"}],"rationale":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is correct. It&rsquo;s given that a hose puts <math alttext=\"88 x\"><mrow>\n<mn>88</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math> ounces of water in a bucket in <math alttext=\"5 y\"><mrow>\n<mn>5</mn>\n<mi>y</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math> minutes. Therefore, the rate at which the hose puts water in the bucket, in ounces per minute, can be represented by the expression <math alttext=\"StartFraction 88 x Over 5 y EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>88</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>. Let <math alttext=\"w\"><mi>w</mi>\n</math> represent the number of ounces of water the hose puts in the bucket in <math alttext=\"9 y\"><mrow>\n<mn>9</mn>\n<mi>y</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math> minutes at this rate. It follows that the rate at which the hose puts water in the bucket, in ounces per minute, can be represented by the expression <math alttext=\"StartFraction w Over 9 y EndFraction\"><mfrac><mi>w</mi><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>. The expressions&nbsp;<math alttext=\"StartFraction 88 x Over 5 y EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>88</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> and&nbsp;<math alttext=\"StartFraction w Over 9 y EndFraction\"><mfrac><mi>w</mi><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> represent the same rate, so it follows that <math alttext=\"StartFraction 88 x Over 5 y EndFraction equals StartFraction w Over 9 y EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>88</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>w</mi><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>. Multiplying both sides of this equation by <math alttext=\"9 y\"><mrow>\n<mn>9</mn>\n<mi>y</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"StartFraction 792 x y Over 5 y EndFraction equals w\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>792</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>w</mi></math>, or <math alttext=\"StartFraction 792 x Over 5 EndFraction equals w\"><mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mfrac>\n<mrow>\n<mn>792</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n<mn>5</mn>\n</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mi>w</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Therefore, the number of ounces of water the hose puts in the bucket in <math alttext=\"9 y\"><mrow>\n<mn>9</mn>\n<mi>y</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math> minutes can be represented by the expression <math alttext=\"StartFraction 792 x Over 5 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n<mfrac>\n<mrow>\n<mn>792</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n<mn>5</mn>\n</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>","externalid":"ea65c30d-d2d3-4c66-b79e-881cd28208cf","correct_answer":["D"]},"createDate":1743430554988,"updateDate":1743430554988}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1743430554988, 1743430554988),
